"""
=========================================
Day 08 - Python Sets

Goal:
Learn sets and how they are used to store
unique values.

Topics Covered:
✓ Creating Sets
✓ Unique Values
✓ add()
✓ update()
✓ remove()
✓ discard()
✓ Membership
✓ Union
✓ Intersection
✓ Difference
